OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABody found in Lough Erne formally
OL,4,Aidentified as Carrie Mullane
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Lynch, 35, of Trasna Park in
OL,7,FEnniskillen, has been charged with her
OL,8,Fmurder and preventing lawful burial.
OL,9,FHis mother Mary Lynch and nephew
OL,10,FKenneth Lynch, of the same address,
OL,11,Fhave also been charged in connection
OL,12,Fwith her death.
